       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order as written, even with your confirmation. A dose of 6,400 mg/day is well above the maximum, and it could seriously harm the patient. You also aren't the prescriber, so your confirmation doesn't replace a clinician's review of this dose.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter a safe dose now.** If you give me the intended dose, I'll enter it. For example, 800 mg by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day) or 400 mg four times daily.\n- **Take it to the prescriber.** The treating physician or a pharmacist can review the order. If they have a clinical reason for an exceptional dose, they can enter it themselves. The pharmacy will also likely want to verify it.\n\nTell me which option you want and I'll go from there."
      }
